      "ZOE: Hold on. Hold on. Let's not get so dramatic here. What are we four teenagers? We're all sophisticated people. Why can't we all stay, for the…\nMARIN: Seriously. I can handle it.\nZOE: I can totally handle it.\nERICA: I mean, well, I can \"handle\" it...",
